  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Chevrolet Colorado /GMC Canyon Crew Cab\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Precisely engineered to be compatible with 2015-2026 Chevrolet Colorado /GMC Canyon Crew Cab, matching manufacturer-set mounting points for a secure, no-drill installation and reliable performance\nConfigurable Slider Option: Our reverse-side adjustable slider lets you move the side steps forward or backward to create your ideal stepping position, giving every passenger comfort and convenience on every ride\nHeavy-Duty Rust-Proof Build: Crafted from full stainless steel with reinforced ABS, these 6-inch step rails hold up to 450 lbs, resist rust and corrosion, plus stand strong against rain, mud, and snow\nSecure Grip Traction: Oversized pedal grips offer powerful traction to keep boots firmly in place, ensuring safe and stable footing whether conditions are wet, icy, muddy, or dusty, for confident entry and exit every time.\nSharp Style & Easy Care: Black end caps protect against bumps while giving your truck a sleek, finished look. Our nerf bars feature a stainless steel surface that wipes clean in seconds, keeping your ride looking sharp and ready for the road\nProfessional installation recommended",
